### Sequence Diagram (SD)

```plantuml
@startuml US072_SD
title US072 - List Company Fleet - Sequence Diagram

actor "Air Transport\nCompany Collaborator" as Collab

participant "ListCompanyFleetUI" as UI
participant "ListCompanyFleetController" as Controller
participant "AuthorizationService" as Authz
participant "AirTransportCompany\nCollaboratorRepository" as CollabRepo
participant "AirTransportCompany\nCollaborator" as CollabEntity
participant "AirTransportCompany" as Company
participant "Aircraft" as AircraftEntity

Collab -> UI : request to list fleet
UI --> Collab : ask for sort option (Registration, Maker, Model, Capacity, Age)

Collab -> UI : select sort option
UI -> Controller : listMyCompanyFleet(sortOption)

Controller -> Authz : ensureAuthenticatedUserHasAnyOf(AIR_TRANSPORT_COMPANY_COLLABORATOR)
Controller -> Authz : session().get().authenticatedUser()
Authz --> Controller : systemUser

Controller -> CollabRepo : findBySystemUser(systemUser)
CollabRepo --> Controller : Optional<AirTransportCompanyCollaborator>

alt collaborator not found
    Controller --> UI : throw IllegalStateException
    UI --> Collab : show error message
else collaborator found
    Controller -> CollabEntity : company()
    CollabEntity --> Controller : company

    Controller -> Company : getFleet()
    Company --> Controller : Iterable<Aircraft>

    Controller -> Controller : convert Iterable to List

    alt sortOption == AGE
        Controller -> AircraftEntity : age()
        AircraftEntity --> Controller : int (calculated dynamic age)
    else sortOption == CAPACITY
        Controller -> AircraftEntity : seats().totalCapacity()
        AircraftEntity --> Controller : int
    else sortOption == MAKER, MODEL, REGISTRATION
        Controller -> AircraftEntity : identity(), modelId()...
        AircraftEntity --> Controller : String
    end

    Controller -> Controller : apply Comparator.sort()

    Controller --> UI : List<Aircraft> (sorted)
    UI --> Collab : display formatted table (Registration, Maker, Model, Capacity, Age, Status)
end

@enduml